# Build output, ignored WHOLE rather than by extension.
#
# Listing extensions left the generated makefiles, sources.mk, objects.list
# and the .json argument files behind, and those carry the absolute path of
# the machine that built them. A judge who builds this tree in place would
# otherwise be one "git add -A" away from committing somebody's home
# directory. Nothing in either directory is authored; a clean build makes all
# of it.
firmware/STM32CubeIDE/FSBL/Debug/
firmware/STM32CubeIDE/FSBL/Release/

# STM32CubeIDE's workspace state, if anyone opens or builds this tree in
# place. It is per-machine and belongs to nobody else.
.metadata/
__pycache__/

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
